<BlogPost
  title="Eclipse Brings Back Veneered Finished Ends — Now Standard on ProCore Plywood Stain Orders (Paint Coming)"
  description="W.W. Wood Products has transitioned every applicable Eclipse plywood stain order to veneered ProCore plywood: veneered finished ends, wall tops, bottoms, and utility tops, in 12 species, 10% plywood upcharge unchanged. Paint on ProCore is coming next."
  author="Ben Miller"
  publishedDate="2026-05-27"
